Leader --> UC_AssetDetail
Leader --> UC_AddAsset
Leader --> UC_EditAsset
Leader --> UC_DeleteAsset
Leader --> UC_ViewBorrowing
Leader --> UC_BorrowingDetail
Leader --> UC_ApproveBorrowing
Leader --> UC_RejectBorrowing
Leader --> UC_ReturnBorrowing
Leader --> UC_ValidateReturn
Leader --> UC_ViewMaintenance
Leader --> UC_MaintenanceDetail
Leader --> UC_EditMaintenance
Leader --> UC_ValidateMaintenance
Leader --> UC_ViewSchedule
Leader --> UC_CreateSchedule
Leader --> UC_EditSchedule
Leader --> UC_UpdateScheduleStatus
Leader --> UC_DeleteSchedule
Leader --> UC_ViewDashboard
