UC_ViewAssets ..> UC_SearchAssets : <<include>>
UC_ViewAssets ..> UC_AssetDetail : <<include>>
UC_ViewBorrowing ..> UC_BorrowingDetail : <<include>>
UC_ViewMaintenance ..> UC_MaintenanceDetail : <<include>>
UC_ViewSchedule ..> UC_ScheduleDetail : <<include>>
UC_ViewUploads ..> UC_DownloadUpload : <<include>>
UC_ViewUploads ..> UC_PreviewUpload : <<include>>
UC_ViewUploads ..> UC_DeleteUpload : <<include>>

note right of Authenticated
  Semua aktor terautentikasi dapat
  mengakses profil, UML, dan riwayat aktivitas.
end note

note bottom of Admin
  Admin memiliki akses paling luas
  pada pengelolaan data dan dokumentasi.
end note

@enduml
